    "For third-party Coding Plans (e.g. MiniMax, Kimi) or compatible proxy endpoints, enter the API base URL and bearer token manually." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für Coding Plans von Drittanbietern (z. B. MiniMax, Kimi) oder kompatible Proxy-Endpunkte gib die API Base URL und das Bearer-Token manuell ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For third-party Coding Plans (e.g. MiniMax, Kimi) or compatible proxy endpoints, enter the API base URL and bearer token manually."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour les Coding Plans tiers (p. ex. MiniMax, Kimi) ou les points de terminaison proxy compatibles, saisissez manuellement l’URL de base de l’API et le jeton Bearer."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サードパーティの Coding Plan（MiniMax、Kimi など）や互換プロキシのエンドポイントを使う場合は、API Base URL と Bearer トークンを手動で入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "타사 Coding Plan(예: MiniMax, Kimi)이나 호환 프록시 엔드포인트를 사용할 때는 API Base URL과 Bearer 토큰을 직접 입력하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для сторонних Coding Plan (например, MiniMax, Kimi) или совместимых прокси-эндпоинтов укажите API Base URL и токен Bearer вручную."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用第三方 Coding Plan（如 MiniMax、Kimi）或兼容的代理端点时，请手动填写 API Base URL 和 Bearer 令牌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用第三方 Coding Plan（如 MiniMax、Kimi）或相容的代理端點時，請手動填寫 API Base URL 和 Bearer 權杖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
