    "iFlytek needs App ID and API Secret — enter them as \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" in the API Key field." : {
      "comment" : "Voice provider credential note",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek benötigt App ID und API Secret – gib sie im Feld „API Key“ im Format „appId;apiKey;apiSecret“ ein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek needs App ID and API Secret — enter them as \"appId;apiKey;apiSecret\" in the API Key field."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek nécessite un App ID et un API Secret — saisissez-les sous la forme « appId;apiKey;apiSecret » dans le champ API Key."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek には App ID と API Secret が必要です。API Key 欄に「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」の形式で入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iFlytek에는 App ID와 API Secret이 필요해요. API Key 필드에 ‘appId;apiKey;apiSecret’ 형식으로 입력하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для iFlytek нужны App ID и API Secret — введите их в поле API Key в формате «appId;apiKey;apiSecret»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讯飞需要 App ID 和 API Secret，请在 API Key 栏中按「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」的格式填写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "訊飛需要 App ID 和 API Secret，請在 API Key 欄位中按「appId;apiKey;apiSecret」的格式填寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
